    "name": "Spiceworks Cloud Apps Comments Devices API",
    "description": "The Spiceworks Cloud Apps API provides a JavaScript SDK for building integrated applications within the Spiceworks IT management platform. The API exposes Help Desk ticketing data, device inventory, and user information to embedded cloud apps. Applications are embedded within the Spiceworks UI and communicate with the platform through the spiceworks-sdk JavaScript library using a postMessage-based bridge. The API uses OAuth 2.0 authentication and provides access to tickets, comments, devices, and user profiles for IT professionals and app developers.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Spiceworks Developer Community",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
